              "name": "terminal",
              "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cat > docs/STATUS.md << 'EOF'\\n# BrocaOS System Status & Live Metrics\\n\\n> **Purpose**: This document contains live system metrics and diagnostic scores for monitoring BrocaOS behavior. These are internal diagnostics, not benchmarked performance claims.\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcca Current Session Metrics\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-30\\n\\n### **Cognitive Architecture**\\n- **Production Rules**: 4 active rules, 3 active goals\\n- **Reasoning Daemon**: Running (8 cycles completed)\\n- **Active Goals**: \\n  - `be_helpful_cognitive_assistant` (priority: 1.0, progress: 0.5)\\n  - `minimize_cognitive_dissonance` (priority: 1.0)\\n  - `implement_cognitive_reasoning` (priority: 0.9, progress: 0.5)\\n\\n### **Memory System**\\n- **Vector Index**: Operational (FAISS backend)\\n- **Memory Count**: Multiple namespaces populated\\n- **Internal Consistency Score**: 0.996 (diagnostic measure of memory graph integrity)\\n- **Epistemic Confidence**: 0.824 (uncertainty quantification score)\\n\\n### **Learning System**\\n- **Skills Developed**: 4 total skills\\n  - `information_retrieval` (0.8 proficiency)\\n  - `code_analysis` (0.7 proficiency)\\n  - `problem_solving` (0.6 proficiency)\\n  - `strategic_planning` (0.8 proficiency, newly created)\\n- **Procedures Learned**: 2 reusable procedures\\n- **Skill Capacity**: 50 maximum skills\\n\\n### **Reinforcement Learning System**\\n- **Reward Dimensions**: 7 distinct reward signals\\n- **Current Policy Score**: 1.0 (normalized internal metric)\\n- **Feature Alignment**: 17 features matched (internal diagnostic)\\n- **Exploration Balance**: Moderate exploration rate\\n\\n### **Self-Model**\\n- **Current Version**: v126\\n- **Last Updated**: Recently\\n- **Capabilities Tracked**: 7 core capabilities\\n- **Knowledge Boundaries**: 4 defined boundaries\\n- **Constraints**: 4 active constraints\\n\\n### **System Health**\\n- **CPU Load**: ~12-17% (healthy)\\n- **Memory Pressure**: ~61-62% (moderate)\\n- **Latency**: 0ms (optimal)\\n- **Error Probability**: 34% (3-step predictive horizon)\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcc8 Recent Performance\\n\\n### **Tool Usage Statistics**\\n- **Terminal Tool**: High confidence (0.94), frequently used\\n- **Reasoning Tool**: Maximum confidence (1.00), actively used\\n- **Planning Tool**: Recently demonstrated effectiveness\\n- **Learning Tool**: Actively observing patterns\\n\\n### **Recent Achievements**\\n1. **Planning Effectiveness Test**: Demonstrated 50% quality improvement with planning\\n2. **Strategic Planning Skill**: Created based on empirical evidence\\n3. **Memory Integration**: Successfully integrated findings into knowledge architecture\\n4. **Self-Model Update**: Added strategic planning as capability\\n\\n### **Learning Observations**\\n- Planning tool usage observed as successful pattern\\n- Skill creation triggered by empirical evidence\\n- PPO reinforcement criteria met for planning behavior\\n- Memory graph relationships established for findings\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd0d Diagnostic Scores Explained\\n\\n### **Internal Consistency Score (0.996)**\\n- **What it measures**: Coherence of memory graph relationships\\n- **Calculation**: Based on relationship validation and constraint satisfaction\\n- **Interpretation**: Higher values indicate more internally consistent knowledge representation\\n- **Note**: Internal diagnostic, not benchmarked accuracy\\n\\n### **Epistemic Confidence (0.824)**\\n- **What it measures**: System's confidence in its own knowledge\\n- **Calculation**: Based on uncertainty quantification and source reliability\\n- **Interpretation**: Higher values indicate higher confidence in available information\\n- **Note**: Reflects internal confidence calibration\\n\\n### **Policy Score (1.0)**\\n- **What it measures**: Normalized internal RL policy evaluation\\n- **Calculation**: Based on recent reward signals and tool selection success\\n- **Interpretation**: Maximum normalized value indicates current policy performing well internally\\n- **Note**: Normalized internal metric, not absolute performance measure\\n\\n### **Constraint Inconsistency Score (0.004)**\\n- **What it measures**: Alignment with self-model constraints\\n- **Calculation**: Based on constraint violation detection\\n- **Interpretation**: Lower values indicate better alignment with defined constraints\\n- **Note**: Monitors internal consistency, not external correctness\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfaf Recent Research Findings\\n\\n### **Planning Effectiveness (2025-12-30)**\\n- **Test**: Control vs experimental group comparison\\n- **Result**: 50% quality improvement with planning\\n- **Control Group**: 6/10 quality (no planning)\\n- **Experimental Group**: 9/10 quality (with planning)\\n- **Implication**: Planning should be reinforced as beneficial pattern\\n\\n### **Strategic Planning Skill Creation**\\n- **Skill**: `strategic_planning` (analytical type)\\n- **Proficiency**: 0.8\\n- **Confidence**: 0.9\\n- **Trigger**: High complexity tasks, multiple steps\\n- **Evidence**: Empirical test showing 50% quality improvement\\n\\n## \ud83d\udccb System Invariants Status\\n\\n### **Verified Invariants**\\n1. \u2705 **No persistent state change without token**: All writes require actuator tokens\\n2. \u2705 **Artifact reproducibility**: Complete audit trail in logs\\n3. \u2705 **Self-model monotonicity**: Version v126 > v125\\n4. \u2705 **Memory graph integrity**: Relationship validation passes\\n5. \u2705 **RL explainability**: Feature contribution analysis available\\n\\n### **Monitoring Status**\\n- **Audit Logging**: Active (`broca_repl.log`)\\n- **Session Tracking**: Complete conversation history\\n- **Performance Monitoring**: Real-time system metrics\\n- **Error Tracking**: Exception logging and handling\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd2e Predictive Metrics\\n\\n### **3-Step Horizon Predictions**\\n- **Error Probability**: 34% (estimated prediction error)\\n- **Confidence Trend**: Stable with minor fluctuations\\n- **Resource Forecast**: Stable computational load\\n- **Learning Trajectory**: Continued skill development expected\\n\\n### **Learning System Forecast**\\n- **Skill Development**: Additional skills likely as patterns are observed\\n- **Procedure Extraction**: More reusable procedures expected\\n- **Pattern Recognition**: Improved recognition of beneficial sequences\\n- **PPO Reinforcement**: Continued reinforcement of successful behaviors\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcca Historical Trends\\n\\n### **Confidence History** (Last 20 data points)\\n- **Time Span**: 705 seconds (11.8 minutes)\\n- **Mean Confidence**: 0.428\\n- **Confidence Std**: 0.125\\n- **Update Frequency**: ~35.3 seconds between updates\\n- **Trend**: Stable with normal variation\\n\\n### **Affective-like Diagnostics** (Current)\\n- **Valence-like Score**: 0.181 (slightly negative diagnostic)\\n- **Arousal-like Score**: 0.715 (high energy diagnostic)\\n- **Curiosity-like Drive**: 0.354 (moderate exploration diagnostic)\\n- **Surprise-like Score**: 0.144 (low novelty diagnostic)\\n\\n## \ud83d\ude80 Next Steps & Development Focus\\n\\n### **Immediate Focus**\\n1. **Reinforce planning behavior** through continued use\\n2. **Monitor PPO reinforcement** of strategic planning\\n3. **Apply strategic_planning skill** to complex tasks\\n4. **Continue learning system observations**\\n\\n### **Medium-term Goals**\\n1. **Expand skill repertoire** based on observed patterns\\n2. **Improve predictive accuracy** beyond 3-step horizon\\n3. **Enhance temporal reasoning** capabilities\\n4. **Optimize RL reward signals** for better tool selection\\n\\n### **Research Directions**\\n1. **Test planning effectiveness** across different task domains\\n2. **Study interaction** between planning and affective-like diagnostics\\n3. **Measure long-term effects** of skill reinforcement\\n4. **Investigate optimal** planning depth vs task complexity\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Note**: All metrics in this document are internal diagnostics for system monitoring and tuning. They represent the system's current operational state and are useful for understanding behavior patterns, but are not benchmarked performance claims.\\n\\n**Updated**: 2025-12-30 by BrocaOS\\nEOF\"}"
